From: SaaiOS <os@saaios>
Subject: synaptics td4150: HDL complete helper when need_*=0 after 0x1b

Stock zeroflash_download_config() when need_disp=need_app=need_osh=0
and host_downloading: clear host_downloading, queue
HELP_SEND_REINIT_NOTIFICATION (identify 0x02 then GET_APPLICATION_INFO
0x20, then touch_reinit), not a silent return. Skip-HDL already cleared
host_downloading, so since20 skipped 0x30 and then looped timeout-0x20
while the IC stayed in HDL-v2 "status reported, waiting for host".

since21:
- Keep skip 0x30 when need_*=0 (stock-correct). Ack HDL complete
  (host_downloading=0, wake hdl_wq). Run the completion helper after
  touch_init: if ATTN idle, CMD_RESET 0x04 first, then one identify.
- Do not call identify/0x20 again if the last attempt timed out.
  Stock helper stops on identify failure (no touch_reinit 0x20).
- Resume does not retry after one failure (no FB-unblank spam).
- Keep in_hdl_mode=0, no ENABLE_REPORT 0x05, no do_polling, no SPI
  read when ATTN idle.

Applies after syna-tcm-sync-download-config.patch.

